# Paths where a change reaches every collaborator's tooling, not only this
# repository's code — so a pull request that touches them gets the owner's
# review before it can merge (enforced once branch protection requires review
# from code owners; this file alone is a request, not a lock).
#
#   .github/workflows/        CI credentials, OIDC grants, what publishes and deploys
#   .claude/                  the hooks Claude Code runs on every tool call, and the
#                             instructions it injects into every session (see
#                             .claude/hooks/inject-instructions.mjs)
#   playground/codemap/_index/refresh.json
#                             the recipe the PostToolUse hook EXECUTES; its trust
#                             gate stores fingerprints outside the repo, so an edit
#                             here is a request for every clone to re-trust it
#   integrations/geml-check-action/action.yml
#                             the composite action other repositories run

